  "description": "Year 2832. Earth has been reduced to ashes by nuclear war. \n\nTreated as an outcast within the research collective tasked with finding a new home for humanity, Chaeon is treated like an expendable card and dispatched alone to the unexplored \"Planet 99.\" Shortly after landing, he detects a brand-new life signal. But before he can celebrate finding humanity’s last beacon of hope, a terrifying, mysterious alien creature ambushes him. ...Except instead of tearing him apart, the creature seems dangerously interested in probing his most sensitive spots! Pushed to the brink of pleasure-induced exhaustion by their ruthless, overpowering search, Chaeon is on the verge of collapsing—until a mysterious, beautiful boy appears before him in the chaos.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
